      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹17.45 (vs ₹13.57 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹17.45 (up from ₹13.57 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹10.7b (up 13% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.96b (up 29% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 28% (up from 24% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 8.5% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 10% growth forecast for the Pharmaceuticals industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 25% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 26% per year.",
